Hi Caroline,

The process to join three datasets could be for example:

library(dartR)
gl.new <http://gl.new> <- gl.join(gl.data.a, gl.data.b)
gl.new <http://gl.new> <- gl.join(gl.new <http://gl.new>, gl.data.c)

Please let us know whether this worked for you.

Cheers,
Luis

