Sample_3 A[0] G[2] G[2] A[0] C[3]
Sample_3 G[2] G[2] G[2] A[0] T[1]

will it be coded in dartR as:

Sample_1 A[1] T[2] C[1] G[1] C[1]
Sample_1 T[2] T[2] G[2] C[2] A[2]
Sample_2 T[2] A[2] C[2] T[1] G[1]
Sample_2 T[2] A[2] C[2] C[2] A[2]
Sample_3 A[1] G[2] G[2] A[2] C[1]
Sample_3 G[2] G[2] G[2] A[2] T[2]
?

Will I get the same result with both input files?

Best,
Evgenii

